{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:05:13+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Secret Agent Wizard Boy", "steam_appid": 3111080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/0e48a0d586edfc3d16e6aad98d39fb66.poster.avif?t=1791469145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/0e48a0d586edfc3d16e6aad98d39fb66.webm?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/0e48a0d586edfc3d16e6aad98d39fb66.mp4?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time to go undercover, alone or up to 4 player co-op. The international crime syndicate S.P.I.D.E.R has taken over your school, operated by evil wizard headmaster Grumblemort! Use your wits to infiltrate the prestigious wizarding academy and explore the area. As you search for clues to his hideout, you’ll find powerful spells, collect very cool and necessary headwear (it’s not a phase!), and duel students.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle hides long-forgotten passage ways, powerful mysteries, highly explosive ordnance, outlandish costumes and. . . well, who knows what you'll find? A new wand would be nice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a wizard means this magic stuff comes naturally to you, but you’ve forgotten most of the interesting spells. Luckily, students have left their notes laying around for you to learn from. Duplicate items, transform into props, grow things to immense sizes, or cast Clownify for. . . clown stuff to happen. Or, grab anything off the ground to brew potions that could heal you, make you powerful, remove gravity, or even delete your bones. Everything is a potion. Not everything is a good potion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Forth and Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Agent Wizard Boy doesn't have guardrails and allows you to play however you want. Follow the main quest to defeat Grumblemort or wreak havoc across the school grounds. If you wish to make your way through the secret dungeons no one is there to stop you, aside from the spiders of course. There are nooks and crannies to explore, there are biscuits to collect, there’s a whole world waiting for you, Wizard Boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/50ec1f4b15adf31095e7e76dcf12c4f3.poster.avif?t=1791469145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/50ec1f4b15adf31095e7e76dcf12c4f3.webm?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/50ec1f4b15adf31095e7e76dcf12c4f3.mp4?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/0e48a0d586edfc3d16e6aad98d39fb66.poster.avif?t=1791469145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/0e48a0d586edfc3d16e6aad98d39fb66.webm?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/0e48a0d586edfc3d16e6aad98d39fb66.mp4?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time to go undercover, alone or up to 4 player co-op. The international crime syndicate S.P.I.D.E.R has taken over your school, operated by evil wizard headmaster Grumblemort! Use your wits to infiltrate the prestigious wizarding academy and explore the area. As you search for clues to his hideout, you’ll find powerful spells, collect very cool and necessary headwear (it’s not a phase!), and duel students.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle hides long-forgotten passage ways, powerful mysteries, highly explosive ordnance, outlandish costumes and. . . well, who knows what you'll find? A new wand would be nice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a wizard means this magic stuff comes naturally to you, but you’ve forgotten most of the interesting spells. Luckily, students have left their notes laying around for you to learn from. Duplicate items, transform into props, grow things to immense sizes, or cast Clownify for. . . clown stuff to happen. Or, grab anything off the ground to brew potions that could heal you, make you powerful, remove gravity, or even delete your bones. Everything is a potion. Not everything is a good potion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Forth and Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Agent Wizard Boy doesn't have guardrails and allows you to play however you want. Follow the main quest to defeat Grumblemort or wreak havoc across the school grounds. If you wish to make your way through the secret dungeons no one is there to stop you, aside from the spiders of course. There are nooks and crannies to explore, there are biscuits to collect, there’s a whole world waiting for you, Wizard Boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/50ec1f4b15adf31095e7e76dcf12c4f3.poster.avif?t=1791469145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/50ec1f4b15adf31095e7e76dcf12c4f3.webm?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/extras/50ec1f4b15adf31095e7e76dcf12c4f3.mp4?t=1791469145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You’re a wizard! And a secret agent. The evil S.P.I.D.E.R crime syndicate has taken over your school, creating chaos. Play solo or up to 4 player co-op as you duel students, discover ancient secrets, and use scandalous spells.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/0f8b90145744854ee885c7d466b9177836df11b7/header.jpg?t=1791469145", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/1cc2f15c32225b65d178d84872e40c6a078ec998/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791469145", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111080/1cc2f15c32225b65d178d84872e40c6a078ec998/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791469145", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core 3.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 980 TI / AMD Radeon-VII<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</stro